        <briefdescription>
<para>Converts a given length to dry mass using an allometric relationship. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The conversion uses the formula: dryMass = coefficientForMassA * length^scaleForMassB</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>length</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
