    <briefdescription>
<para>Functions for converting between organism length and dry mass using allometric relationships. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides functions to convert from length to dry mass and vice versa based on a power-law relationship: dryMass = A * length^B. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
